1
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:15,280
{\an8}<i>hikaru kumo wo tsukinuke</i>

2
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:15,280
<i>Breaking through the flying clouds, I...</i>

3
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,780
{\an8}<i>Fly Away < Fly Away ></i>

4
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:24,170
{\an8}<i>karadajuu ni hirogaru panorama</i>

5
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:24,170
<i>A panorama spreading throughout my body</i>

6
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,500
{\an8}<i>kao wo kerareta chikyuu ga</i>

7
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,500
<i>Kicked in the face, the Earth gets</i>

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,050
{\an8}<i>okotte < okotte ></i>

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,050
<i>Angry < Angry ></i>

10
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:36,640
{\an8}<i>kazan wo bakuhatsu saseru</i>

11
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:36,640
<i>And makes a volcano explode</i>

12
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:43,640
{\an8}<i>toketa koori no naka ni</i>

13
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:43,640
<i>If, in the melted polar ice,</i>

14
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:51,230
{\an8}<i>kyouryuu ga itara tamanori shikomitai ne</i>

15
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:51,230
<i>There is a dinosaur, I want to train it to ride on a ball</i>

16
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:55,860
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

17
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:04,790
{\an8}<i>nani ga okite mo kibun wa heno heno kappa</i>

18
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:04,790
<i>Whatever happens, it won't bother me one bit</i>

19
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:09,670
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA mune ga</i>

20
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:12,590
{\an8}<i>pachi-pachi suru hodo sawagu</i>

21
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:12,590
<i>As loud as my heart pounds,</i>

22
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:14,010
{\an8}<i>Genki Dama</i>

23
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:14,010
<i>The Genki Dama roars.</i>

24
00:01:14,010 --> 00:01:17,760
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

25
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:26,770
{\an8}<i>atama karappo no hou ga yume tsumekomeru</i>

26
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:26,770
<i>A head that's empty is easier to stuff with dreams</i>

27
00:01:26,770 --> 00:01:30,360
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

28
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:34,110
{\an8}<i>egao urutora Z de</i>

29
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:34,110
<i>With a smile that's Ultra-Z</i>

30
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:37,160
{\an8}<i>kyou mo ai-yai-yai-yai-yai......</i>

31
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:37,160
<i>Even today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai......</i>

32
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:39,240
{\an8}<i>Sparking!</i>

33
00:02:07,620 --> 00:02:11,740
<i>Unable to do anything before the overwhelming power of Freeza,</i>

34
00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:14,700
<i>Vegeta thoroughly loses his will to fight.</i>

35
00:02:16,110 --> 00:02:20,910
<i>Until finally, Vegeta's death draws near.</i>

36
00:02:22,210 --> 00:02:23,760
<i>At that moment...</i>

37
00:02:38,620 --> 00:02:42,060
<i>Son Goku finally rises!</i>

38
00:02:46,570 --> 00:02:54,570
{\an8}Such Regret...!!

39
00:02:46,570 --> 00:02:54,570
{\an8}The Proud Saiyan • Vegeta Dies

40
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:08,710
Damn...

41
00:03:27,770 --> 00:03:29,860
Piccolo-san!

42
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:10,440
All right, they're very close.

43
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:13,400
My apologies, I'm coming now! Something might just become of this!

44
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:49,840
How dull. You've utterly lost the will to fight back.

45
00:05:51,730 --> 00:05:55,360
It's a little soon, but maybe I should finish you off.

46
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:05,510
So then, the identity of that huge <i>ki</i> was Piccolo after all.

47
00:07:07,410 --> 00:07:09,050
S-Son!

48
00:07:10,010 --> 00:07:12,910
Nice. You were brought back here with the Dragon Balls, huh?

49
00:07:14,780 --> 00:07:15,540
Father!

50
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,910
Are you all right now?

51
00:07:18,910 --> 00:07:22,790
Yeah. Thanks to you guys, I've recovered from all that damage.

52
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:30,050
You've stuck it out well, Gohan! Leave it up to me now.

53
00:07:30,810 --> 00:07:31,560
What?!

54
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:40,650
Leave it up to you? What, are you planning on taking that freak on by yourself?

55
00:07:40,650 --> 00:07:41,450
Yep.

56
00:07:45,430 --> 00:07:47,130
F-Father!

57
00:07:48,140 --> 00:07:50,330
A-Are you really Goku?

58
00:07:50,330 --> 00:07:53,450
There's something different about the way your <i>ki</i> has felt up until now...

59
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:56,330
S-Son!

60
00:07:56,890 --> 00:08:01,500
<i>Is that Son? He's got an unbelievable strength of ki.</i>

61
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:04,340
<i>There's no comparison to when he was on Earth.</i>

62
00:08:20,990 --> 00:08:23,580
So you're Freeza?

63
00:08:23,580 --> 00:08:26,320
You're much more of a runt than I'd imagined.

64
00:08:28,970 --> 00:08:31,070
So there's still another one of you scum left?

65
00:08:37,230 --> 00:08:40,160
Vegeta has promised to fight with me.

66
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:41,390
Don't you interfere!

67
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:45,760
You... It's like I've seen you before...

68
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:59,770
K-Kakarrot, it's you...

69
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,810
K-Kakarrot?

70
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:04,570
But that name is Saiyan.

71
00:09:12,890 --> 00:09:14,830
It's him!

72
00:09:16,220 --> 00:09:20,250
Freeza! Get out here!

73
00:09:20,910 --> 00:09:23,520
I won't let you get away with this!

74
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:46,910
<i>He looks just like that last Saiyan who opposed me when I destroyed planet Vegeta.</i>

75
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:53,340
I won't let a single one of you Saiyans live.

76
00:10:54,540 --> 00:10:58,350
Don't you see, you would do well just to tremble before me.

77
00:10:59,490 --> 00:11:00,850
Maybe so.

78
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:06,350
<i>H-He's not the same Kakarrot as before...</i>

79
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:12,360
<i>He's at last climbed over the wall of his limitations...</i>

80
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:15,860
<i>Wh-Which means...</i>

81
00:11:17,230 --> 00:11:18,570
Are you ready, then?

82
00:11:20,190 --> 00:11:20,830
Yeah.

83
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:44,490
Wh-What was that? Did Goku just do something?

84
00:11:44,490 --> 00:11:45,940
Unreal!

85
00:11:46,670 --> 00:11:52,320
<i>Not even I could see that clearly. He's exceeded Freeza's speed!</i>

86
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:14,380
Oh, no! Get out of the way, Goku!

87
00:12:33,570 --> 00:12:36,610
Oh, no! Get out of the way, Goku!

88
00:12:37,370 --> 00:12:38,990
You're an impudent one!

89
00:14:10,580 --> 00:14:15,290
It can't be! He deflected every one of them, and with just one hand!

90
00:14:20,990 --> 00:14:25,870
Freeza, you'd better fight like you mean it!

91
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:33,350
H-He's the very thing you fear most...

92
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:38,360
A Super Saiyan!

93
00:14:40,340 --> 00:14:42,410
That's right!

94
00:14:42,410 --> 00:14:48,920
The strongest warrior in the universe, a Super Saiyan!

95
00:14:52,010 --> 00:14:57,420
Freeza, you're finished now! Serves you right!

96
00:15:17,620 --> 00:15:18,270
Vegeta!

97
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:26,160
You knew, Vegeta, that I hate such petty jokes, didn't you?

98
00:15:29,830 --> 00:15:30,660
Vegeta!

99
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:36,040
Hey! Vegeta was in a state where he couldn't even move!

100
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:39,170
There was no reason to finish him off on purpose!

101
00:15:40,110 --> 00:15:44,070
The Super Saiyan is nothing more than a frivolous legend.

102
00:15:44,070 --> 00:15:48,410
He wouldn't stop going on about it. I hate it when people get tedious.

103
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:54,050
K-Kakarrot...

104
00:15:54,050 --> 00:15:54,680
Vegeta!

105
00:15:58,350 --> 00:16:03,780
Are you... still reciting that soft crap?

106
00:16:03,780 --> 00:16:06,110
Are you not a Super Saiyan?!

107
00:16:10,830 --> 00:16:12,160
Wait!

108
00:16:15,950 --> 00:16:19,780
You foolish scum! Get cold-hearted!

109
00:16:19,780 --> 00:16:24,930
If you had only discarded your leniency, you would surely already be...

110
00:16:24,930 --> 00:16:27,170
a Super Saiyan!

111
00:16:27,850 --> 00:16:33,590
I just don't see how I could act as cold-hearted as you do.

112
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:38,020
And as for this Super Saiyan business, I don't know what you mean.

113
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:42,800
A-A Super Saiyan is...

114
00:17:29,930 --> 00:17:31,430
How wonderful!

115
00:17:31,430 --> 00:17:35,610
Look at it, Zarbon-san, Dodoria-san!

116
00:17:35,610 --> 00:17:38,530
Behold such beautiful fireworks!

117
00:17:43,990 --> 00:17:48,010
L-Listen well, Kakarrot...

118
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:53,220
And here I've pierced his heart.

119
00:17:53,220 --> 00:17:55,550
What nerve. Are you going to keep talking?

120
00:17:55,550 --> 00:18:05,290
Your... our planet of birth, Planet Vegeta... was not destroyed...

121
00:18:05,290 --> 00:18:10,610
i-in a collision with a giant meteor...

122
00:18:12,770 --> 00:18:16,530
Don't say any more! You're just hastening your death!

123
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:21,540
Freeza did it...!

124
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:29,410
This after we Saiyans... served as his hands and feet...

125
00:18:30,410 --> 00:18:34,430
working exactly as he ordered...!

126
00:18:35,020 --> 00:18:39,930
Everyone besides us was killed...!

127
00:18:39,930 --> 00:18:45,110
Your father... and my father, the king, as well...!

128
00:18:45,110 --> 00:18:51,510
Freeza... was afraid that as the Saiyans gathered strength...

129
00:18:51,510 --> 00:18:55,950
a Super Saiyan would be born among us...

130
00:18:57,430 --> 00:18:58,950
Just listen to you.

131
00:19:05,370 --> 00:19:07,540
Vegeta!

132
00:19:13,010 --> 00:19:14,740
I-I beg you...!

133
00:19:15,710 --> 00:19:18,930
Freeza... defeat Freeza...!

134
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:29,690
Please... by your Saiyan hand...

135
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:43,640
<i>Vegeta...</i>

136
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:51,520
Has he finally croaked?

137
00:19:52,450 --> 00:19:55,260
Well, shall we reconvene this Show of Terror, then?

138
00:19:59,330 --> 00:20:01,430
For you to cry...

139
00:20:02,870 --> 00:20:05,270
For you to beg of me,

140
00:20:06,250 --> 00:20:08,650
must have been awfully difficult, I bet.

141
00:20:54,700 --> 00:20:56,110
I understand.

142
00:20:56,950 --> 00:21:01,740
It wasn't that your fellow Saiyans had been killed that was rough on you–

143
00:21:03,370 --> 00:21:09,460
having to do as he told you must have been worse than anything you could stand.

144
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:18,590
I hated you so much...

145
00:21:22,110 --> 00:21:24,900
but you had your Saiyan pride.

146
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:52,250
And now I too will share in some of that pride of yours.

147
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:58,160
I am a Saiyan raised on Earth!

148
00:22:01,430 --> 00:22:03,930
For all the Saiyans who were killed by you...

149
00:22:05,570 --> 00:22:09,810
as well as for all the Namekians here...

150
00:22:12,410 --> 00:22:15,570
I am going to beat you!

151
00:22:17,820 --> 00:22:19,480
Such drivel.

152
00:22:22,500 --> 00:22:26,470
<i>Son Goku opens his eyes to his Saiyan pride.</i>

153
00:22:26,470 --> 00:22:31,110
<i>Just how great is his terrible anger?</i>

154
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:48,820
{\an8}<i>kakete kuru yo appuru iro monsutaa</i>

155
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:48,820
<i>Heading this way is an apple-colored monster</i>

156
00:22:48,820 --> 00:22:54,730
{\an8}<i>tonde kuru yo nattsu no kaori eirian</i>

157
00:22:48,820 --> 00:22:54,730
<i>Flying this way is a nut-scented alien</i>

158
00:22:54,730 --> 00:22:57,450
{\an8}<i>deatte dokkin-dokkin</i>

159
00:22:54,730 --> 00:22:57,450
<i>Meeting them makes my heart pound,</i>

160
00:22:57,450 --> 00:22:59,160
{\an8}<i>dokkin-dokkin</i>

161
00:22:57,450 --> 00:22:59,160
<i>pound and pound</i>

162
00:23:00,390 --> 00:23:05,600
{\an8}<i>pika-pika ginga wa poppukoon shawaa</i>

163
00:23:00,390 --> 00:23:05,600
<i>The sparkling galaxy is a popcorn shower</i>

164
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:12,110
{\an8}<i>kinou ni bai-bai-bai (Go-ha-n)</i>

165
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:12,110
<i>Yesterday goes bye-bye-bye (Go-ha-n)</i>

166
00:23:12,110 --> 00:23:16,090
{\an8}<i>fu-shi-gi (ip-pa-i)</i>

167
00:23:12,110 --> 00:23:16,090
<i>Mys-te-ry (All-a-round)</i>

168
00:23:16,090 --> 00:23:19,470
{\an8}<i>chikara o komete (okawari OK)</i>

169
00:23:16,090 --> 00:23:19,470
<i>Focus your strength (second helpings are OK)</i>

170
00:23:19,470 --> 00:23:22,130
{\an8}<i>kochira e rai-rai-rai</i>

171
00:23:19,470 --> 00:23:22,130
<i>Come over this way, rye-rye-rye</i>

172
00:23:23,930 --> 00:23:29,270
{\an8}<i>Woh... mirakuru ZENKAI pawaa!</i>

173
00:23:23,930 --> 00:23:29,270
<i>Ooh... miracle ZENKAI power!</i>

174
00:23:31,730 --> 00:23:33,600
{\an8}<i>haraheri wanpaku Kinto'un</i>

175
00:23:31,730 --> 00:23:33,600
<i>A hungry, naughty Kinto'un</i>

176
00:23:33,600 --> 00:23:35,810
{\an8}<i>yama hodo takusan suiheisen</i>

177
00:23:33,600 --> 00:23:35,810
<i>Lots and lots of horizons</i>

178
00:23:35,810 --> 00:23:39,610
{\an8}<i>deatte wakarete deatte wakarete ta-i-he-n</i>

179
00:23:35,810 --> 00:23:39,610
<i>They meet, they part, they meet, they part, Oh no</i>

180
00:23:39,610 --> 00:23:45,400
{\an8}<i>Ah mou Kami-sama mo tsurai yo ne!</i>

181
00:23:39,610 --> 00:23:45,400
<i>Ah, geez! Even God got it rough</i>

182
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:46,620
{\an8}<i>... go-men</i>

183
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:46,620
<i>...Sor-ry</i>

184
00:23:47,950 --> 00:23:53,120
{\an8}<i>Woh... manpuku ZENKAI pawaa!</i>

185
00:23:47,950 --> 00:23:53,120
<i>Ooh... Full-bellied ZENKAI power!</i>

186
00:23:55,500 --> 00:24:00,780
{\an8}<i>detekoi tobikiri ZENKAI pawaa!</i>

187
00:23:55,500 --> 00:24:00,780
<i>Come on out, incredible ZENKAI power!</i>

188
00:24:08,760 --> 00:24:11,430
{\an8}Preview

189
00:24:12,760 --> 00:24:14,740
<i>Heya! I'm Goku!</i>

190
00:24:14,740 --> 00:24:18,650
<i>Freeza! Don't go messing up other people's planets so much!</i>

191
00:24:18,650 --> 00:24:20,060
<i>What'll you do if you go and break it?</i>

192
00:24:20,060 --> 00:24:23,730
<i>These Saiyan characters are strange ones.</i>

193
00:24:23,730 --> 00:24:26,440
<i>There's no upper limit to his strength.</i>

194
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:28,450
<i>Next time on Dragon Ball Z:</i>

195
00:24:28,450 --> 00:24:32,450
<i>"The Curtain Rises over the Ultimate Battle!! I Am Going to Defeat You."</i>

196
00:24:32,940 --> 00:24:36,160
<i>Father is strong! The strongest in the universe!</i>

197
00:24:34,700 --> 00:24:38,460
{\an8}Next time

198
00:24:34,700 --> 00:24:38,460
{\an8}The Curtain Rises over the Ultimate Battle!!

199
00:24:34,700 --> 00:24:38,460
{\an8}I Am Going to Defeat You

